{
  "title": "Jovial Smoky Irish Lamb Stew",
  "description": "A hearty one-pot Irish dish featuring smoky lamb, dill, and a soffritto base, perfect for a cold evening. This recipe is diabetic-friendly and serves 6 people.",
  "cuisine": "Irish",
  "diet": [
    "diabetic-friendly",
